### WebStorm / VS Code (REST Client). اول login بزن و csrfToken را در متغیر بگذار.
@host = http://localhost:5173
@csrf = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

GET {{host}}/api/health

###
GET {{host}}/api/public/menu

###
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@example.com","password":"your-long-password"}

###
GET {{host}}/api/admin/categories

###
POST {{host}}/api/admin/categories
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"title":"دسته‌ی تست"}

###
POST {{host}}/api/admin/items/1
X-HTTP-Method-Override: PATCH
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"price":99000}
